# Sahal frontend security headers (Netlify/CDN format)
# خادم frontend/server.js يضبطها مباشرةً في Render؛ هذه النسخة لأي مضيف CDN مستقبلي.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://sahal-project.onrender.com wss://sahal-project.onrender.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; form-action 'self'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin